{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1097574-mages-and-the-underworld-looking-for-book-recommendations","id":1097574,"title":"Mages and the Underworld (looking for book recommendations)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-27T11:31:56-07:00","id":1097574,"title":"Mages and the Underworld (looking for book recommendations)","content":"Greetings all!<br /> <br /> I am starting a new game in the a few weeks and I have a player who is keenly interested in Death, Ghosts and the Underworld. Mage 2e is a bit sparse on the details of the Underworld and none of my existing Mage sourcebooks seem to cover it any detail. I was hoping you guys could recommend a few titles with more information?<br /> <br /> Furthermore I was hoping for some advice on how Mages interact with the Underworld. Summon Ghost has a reach option for pulling ghosts through an Avernian Gate but says they have to be 'in the underworld vicinity of that Iris.' Is there any way an enterprising necromancer could call up specific ghosts from the Underworld he wanted to consult with?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-27T11:41:31-07:00","id":1097576,"title":"","content":"There is the summoner book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMa